{"3381120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZDSimulator", "steam_appid": 3381120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3542730, 3542740, 3609190, 3609200, 3609210, 3609220, 3609230, 3609240, 3614750, 3614760, 3614770, 3614780, 3614790, 3614800, 3614810, 3614820, 3614830, 3614840, 3614850, 3614860, 3614870, 3614880, 3614890, 3614910, 3614920, 3614930, 3614940, 3615040, 3894010, 3894420, 3894430, 3980150, 4114940, 4139780, 4158050, 4366030, 4524730, 4735370], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ZDSimulator – a railway simulator created by professional train drivers and railway fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaunch of the legendary Ukrainian simulator ZDSimulator on Steam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project was initially developed in 2007 as a simulator for training Ukrainian train drivers, but in the future, it quickly gained popularity among fans of railway simulators and was actively developed by the community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are offered a unique opportunity to get acquainted with the real control of well-developed locomotives on real routes created by our team and other developers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will feel like a train driver and will be able to try to drive both a heavy freight train and a high-speed passenger train in unique and interesting scenarios offered by our simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through exact copies of real railway sections in free mode and multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the emotions and go through the challenges from the real practice of train drivers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple and complex mode, suitable for both beginners and full immersion enthusiasts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic physics of locomotive and train control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Detailed development of electrical circuits and locomotive devices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ability for the instructor to set various faults and emergencies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 50 routes, which is more than 3000 km of real track profile and stations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Network play capability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - visibility of participants to each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - driving at a distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - dispatcher control of signals and movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with love for the community by professional train drivers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit in the ZDSimulator cab, learn the control system, and hit the road!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ZDSimulator – a railway simulator created by professional train drivers and railway fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaunch of the legendary Ukrainian simulator ZDSimulator on Steam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project was initially developed in 2007 as a simulator for training Ukrainian train drivers, but in the future, it quickly gained popularity among fans of railway simulators and was actively developed by the community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are offered a unique opportunity to get acquainted with the real control of well-developed locomotives on real routes created by our team and other developers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will feel like a train driver and will be able to try to drive both a heavy freight train and a high-speed passenger train in unique and interesting scenarios offered by our simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through exact copies of real railway sections in free mode and multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the emotions and go through the challenges from the real practice of train drivers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple and complex mode, suitable for both beginners and full immersion enthusiasts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic physics of locomotive and train control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Detailed development of electrical circuits and locomotive devices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ability for the instructor to set various faults and emergencies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 50 routes, which is more than 3000 km of real track profile and stations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Network play capability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - visibility of participants to each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - driving at a distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - dispatcher control of signals and movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with love for the community by professional train drivers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit in the ZDSimulator cab, learn the control system, and hit the road!</p>", "short_description": "ZDSimulator is a unique project of the real professional training apparatus for train driving schools, which is now available to any user as a railway simulator", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Ukrainian, French, Czech, German, Polish, Kazakh, Spanish - Spain, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381120/header.jpg?t=1782650362", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381120/d3263324fd84549f7ffe76a07d74aea3a6f7e550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782650362", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381120/d3263324fd84549f7ffe76a07d74aea3a6f7e550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782650362", "website": "https://zdsimulator.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</